WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.015
A curriculum vitae can account for each appointment yet

00:00:04.015 --> 00:00:07.580
leave out the months a researcher spent merely trying

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.768
to remain functional.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:20.403
A curriculum vitae organizes years into posts and

00:00:20.403 --> 00:00:23.862
publications. It rarely records uncertainty, strain or

00:00:23.862 --> 00:00:26.827
the cost of being constantly evaluated.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.507
Finish the experiment, submit the draft, apply for the

00:00:35.507 --> 00:00:39.243
next award. A system can keep moving the point at which

00:00:39.243 --> 00:00:41.281
its members are allowed to rest.

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:53.411
Good supervision offers criticism that improves the

00:00:53.411 --> 00:00:56.807
science without confusing professional standards with

00:00:56.807 --> 00:00:57.939
personal humiliation.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:07.394
Academic work asks for persistence, but turning every

00:01:07.394 --> 00:01:10.845
sacrifice into a badge of commitment produces

00:01:10.845 --> 00:01:12.324
incentives worth examining.

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:21.433
The pressure to appear perpetually productive is built

00:01:21.433 --> 00:01:24.918
into academic routines. Trace it without reducing

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:26.910
people to inspirational examples.

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:35.132
Scientific institutions should ask which parts of their

00:01:35.132 --> 00:01:38.353
incentives make research needlessly cruel, not only

00:01:38.353 --> 00:01:40.654
whether students can tolerate them.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:49.727
Good science benefits when institutional expectations

00:01:49.727 --> 00:01:53.550
can be questioned as carefully as experimental

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:54.097
assumptions.
